      "article_id": "a1_83ea570d59395ca129ff10cd",
      "headline": "At least 13 killed in Ukrainian drone strike deep into Russia",
      "confirmed_facts": [
        {
          "fact_id": "f1",
          "text": "At least 13 killed in Ukrainian drone strike deep into Russia - Published At least 13 people have been killed in a Ukrainian drone strike on the Russian republic of Tatarstan, local officials have said.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-11T08:03:01.096882+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "633f26560a905ce029eb581fadfd5b1cc984d9dbc9a33c1296a9492b09554b35",
          "excerpt": "At least 13 killed in Ukrainian drone strike deep into Russia - Published At least 13 people have been killed in a Ukrainian drone strike on the Russian republic of Tatarstan, local officials have said.",
          "sentence_hash": "09016348ec502452f6ce0c1728a641db74663682a67feb4ce3e8619ea877c7b6",
          "anchors": [
            "13 people",
            "13 killed"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f2",
          "text": "They confirmed one child was among those killed, with 75 more people injured as drones hit Nizhnekamsk, more than 1,100 kilometres (680m) from the Ukrainian border.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-11T08:03:01.096926+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "633f26560a905ce029eb581fadfd5b1cc984d9dbc9a33c1296a9492b09554b35",
          "excerpt": "They confirmed one child was among those killed, with 75 more people injured as drones hit Nizhnekamsk, more than 1,100 kilometres (680m) from the Ukrainian border.",
          "sentence_hash": "b04a000d664370809b4cba20a3bd15b21366c06ee1da3c31754f17ea17fed5e4",
          "anchors": [
            "more"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f3",
          "text": "Ukraine's Armed Forces said the city's Tanevo oil refinery had been hit.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-11T08:03:01.096951+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "633f26560a905ce029eb581fadfd5b1cc984d9dbc9a33c1296a9492b09554b35",
          "excerpt": "Ukraine's Armed Forces said the city's Tanevo oil refinery had been hit.",
          "sentence_hash": "932320be7f57e4a785ee070d325449631a6a6f4604f5a1454638c28bee434fbf",
          "anchors": [
            "oil"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f4",
          "text": "The strike on Nizhnekamsk lasted several hours overnight and into the morning, according to local sources.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-11T08:03:01.096988+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "633f26560a905ce029eb581fadfd5b1cc984d9dbc9a33c1296a9492b09554b35",
          "excerpt": "The strike on Nizhnekamsk lasted several hours overnight and into the morning, according to local sources.",
          "sentence_hash": "4104742ae275633f3571f8193f8fca46920a4139869d364c22158b184eff2ebc",
          "anchors": [
            "according"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f5",
          "text": "The BBC has not independently verified this information.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-11T08:03:01.097029+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "633f26560a905ce029eb581fadfd5b1cc984d9dbc9a33c1296a9492b09554b35",
          "excerpt": "The BBC has not independently verified this information.",
          "sentence_hash": "9cff3121b732b265421ad0030a1337914a86d071a7ef47883bc3c69b524c40ef",
          "anchors": [
            "verified"
          ]
        },
        {
          "fact_id": "f6",
          "text": "Elsewhere in Russia, fires broke out when an industrial facility in Siberia's Tyumen region was hit by several falling drones, according to local authorities.",
          "source_id": "source:primary",
          "captured_at": "2026-08-11T08:03:01.097129+08:00",
          "content_sha256": "633f26560a905ce029eb581fadfd5b1cc984d9dbc9a33c1296a9492b09554b35",
          "excerpt": "Elsewhere in Russia, fires broke out when an industrial facility in Siberia's Tyumen region was hit by several falling drones, according to local authorities.",
          "sentence_hash": "1d7ecadb87bb5fe7d1b8cdef7a31976250633a3e8cfb82982317dee3d5893e68",
          "anchors": [
